Current Version can be found [[Annoying Dog|here]]. Previous Versions of the Annoying Dog can be found [[Annoying Dog/Previous_Versions|here]].

Dog Residue was originally a mill card given to the opponent by Annoying Dog with pitiful stats. Starting as a 1/1/1, '''Alpha 2.0''' buffed Annoying Dog by making the Residue cost 2G. This was reverted in '''Beta 4.8''', only to be brought back to 2G, but also +1 HP, in '''Beta 5.2'''.

'''Beta 56.0''' reworked both card, with Dog Residue now being given to the user and gaining -1 cost (again) and +1/+1, resulting in 2/3 for a mere 1G. Dog Residue was also turned into a [[:Category:Dog|Dog]] for the first time.

